    "title": "Vanquish Neo UHPLC System",
    "excerpt":"A compact nano-flow UHPLC system   The Vanquish Neo is a UHPLC system for nano-, capillary-, and micro-flow LC-MS with a pressure rating of 1500 bar.      System specifications                  Specification       Value                       System pressure       up to 1500 bar (21,750 psi)                 Flow range       1 nL/min – 100 µL/min, in 1 nL increments                 Recommended flow range       100 nL/min – 100 µL/min                 Injection volume range       0.01 – 25 µL                 Injection precision, 0.05–0.20 µL       ≤ 5.0% RSD                 Injection precision, 0.20–0.50 µL       ≤ 1.5% RSD                 Injection precision, 0.50–2.00 µL       ≤ 0.5% RSD                 Injection precision, above 2 µL       ≤ 0.25% RSD          ","url": "https://proteomicsresource.washington.edu/facility/instruments/VanquishNeo/"
