    "title": "Reagents & Consumables",
    "excerpt":"Parts and consumables used on the UWPR LC-MS systems   Self-service users provide their own consumables, most importantly autosampler vials, the analytical column, and the trapping column. You can pack your own columns using the UWPR packing station. See the column preparation protocols on the Protocols &amp; Methods page.   The tables below list the parts we and our collaborators order most often. Bold rows are the consumables routinely used for bottom-up proteomics at the UWPR. The remaining rows are alternatives that also work on our systems. Most products are listed with their Fisher Scientific catalog number, but they may be found from other vendors. For quality control runs, UWPR users can use the UWPR-provided angiotensin/neurotensin peptide standard. Any other standard must be supplied by the user.   Third-party products appear on this page as suggestions only. They do not constitute an endorsement by the UWPR.   Autosampler vials and caps                  Part #       Item       Vendor       Notes                       03-452-358       SureSTART 2 mL polypropylene snap top microvials (6ERV1103PPC)       Fisher Scientific       Pack of 100; 0.2 mL volume, 4 µL residual volume                 03-452-381       SureSTART 11 mm snap caps, white silicone/red PTFE, star pre-slit (6PRC11STS1X)       Fisher Scientific       Pack of 100; recommended for use with all autosamplers                 01-549-791       SureSTART 11 mm snap caps, white silicone/blue PTFE, pre-slit       Fisher Scientific       Color-coded caps: clear 01-549-791, green 01-549-817, yellow 01-549-832, red 03-452-382, blue 03-452-372                 03-452-259       SureSTART 2 mL polypropylene screw top microvials (6ESV9-04PP)       Fisher Scientific       0.3 mL volume, 4 µL residual volume; use with 9 mm screw caps                 03-452-313       SureSTART 9 mm screw caps (6PSC9STB1)       Fisher Scientific       Pre-slit caps in several colors and septum types: gray 03-452-312, blue 03-452-268, red 03-452-297, yellow 01-549-829, green 03-007-504                 03-452-250       SureSTART 1.7 mL glass high recovery screw top microvials (6ASV9-V1)       Fisher Scientific       If you prefer glass vials                 03-452-550       SureSTART total recovery glass screw top microvials (6PSV9-TR1)       Fisher Scientific       Glass, total recovery                 03-452-247       SureSTART 0.3 mL glass screw top microvials (6PSV903FIVP)       Fisher Scientific       For small sample volumes; also available as 03-452-248 (6PSV9-03FIVAP)                 03-452-575       SureSTART 0.2 mL TPX screw top microvials with glass insert       Fisher Scientific       For small sample volumes                 03-452-576       SureSTART specification certified screw vial and cap kits (6PK1655)       Fisher Scientific       Vials and caps in one kit           Well plates and seals (Vanquish Neo)                  Part #       Item       Vendor       Notes                       03-255-006       SureSTART WebSeal 96-well deep well plates, square V-bottom (60180-P135B)       Fisher Scientific       Pack of 50                 03-255-011       SureSTART WebSeal 96-well low volume plates (60180-P210B)       Fisher Scientific       Pack of 50                 03-255-008       SureSTART WebSeal 96-well deep well plates, round U-bottom (60180-P201B)       Fisher Scientific       Pack of 50                 60180M210       SureSTART WebSeal 96-well plate sealing mats, 5.6 mm round (60180-M210)       Fisher Scientific       Pack of 50                 60180M185       SureSTART WebSeal 96-well plate sealing mats, 8 mm square (60180-M185)       Fisher Scientific       Pack of 50                 03-252-444       WebSeal sealing tapes (60180-M146)       Fisher Scientific       Pack of 100           Column packing supplies   Analytical columns use about 50 cm of 75 µm ID fused silica each; trap columns (EASY-nLC) use about 30 to 40 cm of 100 µm ID fused silica and are reusable many times.   Fused silica tubing                  Part #       Item       Vendor       Notes                       50-110-8582       TSP075375 fused silica capillary tubing, 75 µm ID x 363 µm OD, 10 m spool       Fisher Scientific       For analytical columns; search TSP075375 at fishersci.com for other spool lengths                 50-110-7685       TSP100375 fused silica capillary tubing, 100 µm ID x 363 µm OD, 10 m spool       Fisher Scientific       For trap columns; search TSP100375 for other spool lengths           Frits for trap columns   See the fritted fused silica protocol for making Kasil frits.                  Part #       Item       Vendor       Notes                       NC0263146       Next Advance Kasil formamide frit kit       Fisher Scientific                         50-828-816       Potassium silicate solution, 29.8° Baumé (Pfaltz &amp; Bauer P23830)       Fisher Scientific       Together with formamide, an alternative to the kit                 AC205821000       Formamide, 99.5%, for analysis (ACROS Organics)       Fisher Scientific                   Packing material                  Part #       Item       Vendor       Notes                       r15.aq.0001       ReproSil-Pur 120 C18-AQ, 5 µm, 1 g       ESI Source Solutions       Dr. Maisch bulk packing material (C18-AQ, 120 Å) used for analytical and trap columns; the same beads are available from Fisher as NC1394928           Other chemistries, pore sizes, and particle sizes are available from Dr. Maisch through ESI Source Solutions.   Tools                  Part #       Item       Vendor       Notes                       06-717-592       Restek ceramic scoring wafers, 5-pack       Fisher Scientific       For cutting fused silica                 14-513-64SIX       Fisherbrand Spinbar magnetic micro stir bars, 1.5 mm x 8 mm, 6-pack       Fisher Scientific       One per bead slurry; they are easily lost, so get 5 to 10           Commercial columns, spray tips, and trap cartridges (Vanquish Neo)   Make sure to use insulated column holders to prevent arcing.                  Part #       Item       Vendor       Notes                       UH-753       VHP micro adapter tee, 1/16 in to 360 µm OD       IDEX Health &amp; Science       Connects the spray tip to the column                 03-255-020       PepMap Neo trap cartridge holder, PEEK tubing, and nanoViper fittings (174502)       Fisher Scientific       Complete kit with nanoViper tubing and union cartridge holder                 03-255-018       PepMap Neo trap cartridges, 3-pack (174500)       Fisher Scientific       5 µm C18, 300 µm x 5 mm, 100 Å                 ODY3-15075C18       Odyssey Elite 15 cm x 75 µm C18 UHPLC packed emitter column       IonOpticks       1.7 µm, 120 Å; integrated spray tip                 ODY3-25075C18       Odyssey Ultimate 25 cm x 75 µm C18 UHPLC packed emitter column       IonOpticks       1.7 µm, 120 Å; integrated spray tip                 1893477       PepSep C18 column, 25 cm x 75 µm, 1.9 µm       ESI Source Solutions       See also PepSep columns at Bruker                 Ref:20-05       The Sharp Singularity spray tips, 20 µm ID x 5 cm       ESI Source Solutions       For self-packed columns                 DNV75150PN       PepMap Neo UHPLC column, 2 µm C18, 75 µm x 150 mm, double nanoViper       Thermo                         6040.2304       Union for Viper and nanoViper tubing       Thermo                  ","url": "https://proteomicsresource.washington.edu/resources/consumables/"
